  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>spatial-empirical-bayes-rates</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{smoothed}{r_i}&amp;=\\term{weight}{w_i}\\,\\term{ownRate}{y_i}+(1-w_i)\\,\\term{priorMean}{m_i},\n&amp;\\term{weight}{w_i}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{priorVariance}{a_i}}{a_i+m_i/\\term{ownPopulation}{b_i}}\\\\\n\\term{priorMean}{m_i}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{eventSum}{E_i}}{\\term{populationSum}{B_i}},\n&amp;\\term{priorVariance}{a_i}&amp;=\\max\\!\\left(\\frac{\\term{deviationSum}{\\sum_j b_j(y_j-m_i)^2}}{B_i}-\\frac{m_i}{B_i/\\term{count}{n_i}},0\\right)\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">r_i = w_i y_i + (1 - w_i) m_i; w_i = a_i / (a_i + m_i / b_i), 0 where the denominator is not positive; m_i = E_i / B_i; a_i = max(sum_j b_j (y_j - m_i)^2 / B_i - m_i / (B_i / n_i), 0). The neighbourhood j is row i plus its listed neighbours that are included (unmasked, finite e, finite b &gt; 0); only the structure of the weights counts. E_i, B_i = sums of e and b over the n_i members. The spatial rate is m_i itself. Excluded rows are NaN.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"smoothed\">smoothed · output · smoothed</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"weight\">weight · intermediate · weight</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"ownRate\">ownRate · intermediate · ownRate</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"priorMean\">priorMean · intermediate · priorMean</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"priorVariance\">priorVariance · intermediate · priorVariance</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"ownPopulation\">ownPopulation · input · ownPopulation</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"eventSum\">eventSum · intermediate · eventSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"populationSum\">populationSum · intermediate · populationSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:spatial-empirical-bayes-rates-smooth\" data-value=\"deviationSum\">deviationSum · intermediate · deviationSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-acti