  "formula": {
    "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{smoothed}{r_i}&=\\term{weight}{w_i}\\,\\term{ownRate}{y_i}+(1-w_i)\\,\\term{priorMean}{m_i},\n&\\term{weight}{w_i}&=\\frac{\\term{priorVariance}{a_i}}{a_i+m_i/\\term{ownPopulation}{b_i}}\\\\\n\\term{priorMean}{m_i}&=\\frac{\\term{eventSum}{E_i}}{\\term{populationSum}{B_i}},\n&\\term{priorVariance}{a_i}&=\\max\\!\\left(\\frac{\\term{deviationSum}{\\sum_j b_j(y_j-m_i)^2}}{B_i}-\\frac{m_i}{B_i/\\term{count}{n_i}},0\\right)\n\\end{aligned}",
    "ascii": "r_i = w_i y_i + (1 - w_i) m_i; w_i = a_i / (a_i + m_i / b_i), 0 where the denominator is not positive; m_i = E_i / B_i; a_i = max(sum_j b_j (y_j - m_i)^2 / B_i - m_i / (B_i / n_i), 0). The neighbourhood j is row i plus its listed neighbours that are included (unmasked, finite e, finite b > 0); only the structure of the weights counts. E_i, B_i = sums of e and b over the n_i members. The spatial rate is m_i itself. Excluded rows are NaN.",
